<title>JAPAN: Daiken Corp -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiken Corp -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		115.27		vs	  110.23</p>
<p> Operating	    4.28		vs	    3.87</p>
<p> Current		4.35		vs	    3.56</p>
<p> Net		    1.91		vs	    1.67</p>
<p> EPS		   14.38 yen	  vs	   12.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    133 million	  vs	 132 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p> -Commem div	     -		vs	    1.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiken Corp is a manufacturer of wooden fibreboards and mineral fibreboards.</p>
